cff-version: 1.2.0
title: mypibypy
abstract: >-
  piFISH split-probe (P1L/P1R) design into reusable amplifier systems for
  genomic loci, fusion junctions and RNA targets, with pair-aware local
  specificity screening, amplifier-pool cross-hybridization screening and
  buffer-aware duplex thermodynamics. Usable from the command line, a
  browser UI or as MCP tools.
authors:
  - family-names: Staller
    given-names: Seth
    affiliation: St. Jude Children's Research Hospital
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/sstaller-sj/mypibypy
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
